Source-only main release hold (D-33, 2026-09-30).
While this tracked file exists, the repository SessionStart hook must not
bootstrap, update the user home, or start its update checks. The Claude
marketplace entry is separately pinned to the pre-integration main commit.
The main-push GitHub Actions release workflow must not create a tag or release.
Removing this file and advancing that pin/version require a distinct reviewed
release decision, host verification, rollback proof, and exact-HEAD CI.
